# About Decisions

Your decisions live here — one dated record per settled choice (`type: decision`): what was decided, why, which alternatives it closed, who decided, and when it is worth revisiting. The folder sits at eye level on purpose, because a decisions space nested inside Knowledge is a space you have to be told about. It is one space for all of them: a decision belonging to a project is tagged with that project and still lives here, and the per-project view is rebuilt into `System/Generated/index-decision.md`. One thing worth knowing: `System/Governance/Active Decisions.md` is the *product's* own register — how this system is built — and is overwritten by product updates. Your decisions never go there.
